## Area one

### Alpha rule

**Alpha rule** — the opening label, which is the only one the check compares.

**The rejected alternative** was to compare every bold span in the body. That is a lead-in,
not a label, and this repo writes them throughout; comparing them would fail every entry
that explains what it turned down.
